{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Astro Combat",
    "steam_appid": 3402330,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/50031cc5402956f989ef5aa0ae3963c8.avif?t=1753785118\" width=600 height=132 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/5e602989c57d79e316206fb6a9ccef70.webp?t=1753785118\" width=600 height=12 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/ae0382b478cea0226acde9fdb6f426a0.avif?t=1753785118\" width=600 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Introduction]\uff1a</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A space explorer with a dream of living freely has been pursuing infinite energy. Just as he is about to complete the construction of a Dyson Sphere, he is suddenly attacked by a more advanced civilization, losing everything and forced to flee. He makes an emergency landing on an unknown planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone and with limited resources, he must start from scratch, searching for supplies, rebuilding his life, and rekindling his dream of freedom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During his journey, he encounters one of twelve trapped Star Sprites, who seeks help and hopes that her sisters can also be rescued.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept this mission and delve deep into the secrets of this mysterious planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will traverse various regions, experience exotic cultures, make friends, face challenges, and ultimately save all the Star Sprites, absorbing their energy to repair your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Afterward, you can continue to take on more challenges in the vast universe. Completing the story doesn't necessarily mean the game is over~</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/5e602989c57d79e316206fb6a9ccef70.webp?t=1753785118\" width=600 height=12 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/5ee732a2f5ce486c4a1e55303f2acb29.avif?t=1753785118\" width=600 height=84 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Team Composition] :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can form a squad of up to four members at a time, using their skills and switching team members to achieve optimal combat coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Combat System] :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[1]\u00a0 Action-Packed Combat</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>\u2605 For a thrilling experience, dive right into the action!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game offers the fast-paced excitement of an arcade beat-'em-up. Grab enemies and throw them around\u2014cars, boxes, bottles, anything goes! Don\u2019t hold back; you can even toss enemies off cliffs, into water, or into factory gears for satisfying environmental kills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/6fb92383fb633a26525e2fe1dfa4915c.poster.avif?t=1753785118\" width=640 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/6fb92383fb633a26525e2fe1dfa4915c.webm?t=1753785118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/6fb92383fb633a26525e2fe1dfa4915c.mp4?t=1753785118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect energy by attacking enemies, and when your energy bar is full, unleash powerful ultimate moves for a satisfying monster-slaying experience. Hahahaha...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/09f7fc67bcc174ba7407728777812d44.poster.avif?t=1753785118\" width=640 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/09f7fc67bcc174ba7407728777812d44.webm?t=1753785118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/09f7fc67bcc174ba7407728777812d44.mp4?t=1753785118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/5e602989c57d79e316206fb6a9ccef70.webp?t=1753785118\" width=600 height=12 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[2]\u00a0 Stealth Infiltration</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>\u2605 For a more strategic experience, choose to play stealthily.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you aim for perfect combat outcomes, you can opt for a stealth approach. Knock out enemies and cleverly hide their bodies to earn more rewards. This requires careful planning and strategic thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/844395acdeeb16331b923b90bee12575.poster.avif?t=1753785118\" width=640 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/844395acdeeb16331b923b90bee12575.webm?t=1753785118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/844395acdeeb16331b923b90bee12575.mp4?t=1753785118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/5e602989c57d79e316206fb6a9ccef70.webp?t=1753785118\" width=600 height=12 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>\u2605 Epic Boss Battles, Worth Every Moment!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss has unique characteristics. Experience their power and defeat them to feel a great sense of accomplishment!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/bd84795c893ce5c24cf89bfe60dadebb.poster.avif?t=1753785118\" width=640 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/bd84795c893ce5c24cf89bfe60dadebb.webm?t=1753785118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/bd84795c893ce5c24cf89bfe60dadebb.mp4?t=1753785118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/5e602989c57d79e316206fb6a9ccef70.webp?t=1753785118\" width=600 height=12 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>\u25b6 Equipment and Item Crafting :</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a rich equipment system where items are obtained through synthesis. All materials come from battles, and the success rate for synthesis is 100%. There is no durability system for equipment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/9d335618cccec23b4427c687374f19f4.poster.avif?t=1753785118\" width=640 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/9d335618cccec23b4427c687374f19f4.webm?t=1753785118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/9d335618cccec23b4427c687374f19f4.mp4?t=1753785118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/5e602989c57d79e316206fb6a9ccef70.webp?t=1753785118\" width=600 height=12 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>\u2665 Summary</strong></i> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game combines action-packed combat, stealth infiltration, and epic boss battles, all set against the backdrop of a mysterious and diverse alien world. With a compelling storyline and endless challenges, it offers players a deeply immersive and rewarding experience. Whether you prefer intense action or strategic stealth, there's something for everyone in this expansive universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/50031cc5402956f989ef5aa0ae3963c8.avif?t=1753785118\" width=600 height=132 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/5e602989c57d79e316206fb6a9ccef70.webp?t=1753785118\" width=600 height=12 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/ae0382b478cea0226acde9fdb6f426a0.avif?t=1753785118\" width=600 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Introduction]\uff1a</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A space explorer with a dream of living freely has been pursuing infinite energy. Just as he is about to complete the construction of a Dyson Sphere, he is suddenly attacked by a more advanced civilization, losing everything and forced to flee. He makes an emergency landing on an unknown planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone and with limited resources, he must start from scratch, searching for supplies, rebuilding his life, and rekindling his dream of freedom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During his journey, he encounters one of twelve trapped Star Sprites, who seeks help and hopes that her sisters can also be rescued.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept this mission and delve deep into the secrets of this mysterious planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will traverse various regions, experience exotic cultures, make friends, face challenges, and ultimately save all the Star Sprites, absorbing their energy to repair your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Afterward, you can continue to take on more challenges in the vast universe. Completing the story doesn't necessarily mean the game is over~</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/5e602989c57d79e316206fb6a9ccef70.webp?t=1753785118\" width=600 height=12 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/5ee732a2f5ce486c4a1e55303f2acb29.avif?t=1753785118\" width=600 height=84 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Team Composition] :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can form a squad of up to four members at a time, using their skills and switching team members to achieve optimal combat coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Combat System] :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[1]\u00a0 Action-Packed Combat</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>\u2605 For a thrilling experience, dive right into the action!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game offers the fast-paced excitement of an arcade beat-'em-up. Grab enemies and throw them around\u2014cars, boxes, bottles, anything goes! Don\u2019t hold back; you can even toss enemies off cliffs, into water, or into factory gears for satisfying environmental kills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/6fb92383fb633a26525e2fe1dfa4915c.poster.avif?t=1753785118\" width=640 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/6fb92383fb633a26525e2fe1dfa4915c.webm?t=1753785118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/6fb92383fb633a26525e2fe1dfa4915c.mp4?t=1753785118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect energy by attacking enemies, and when your energy bar is full, unleash powerful ultimate moves for a satisfying monster-slaying experience. Hahahaha...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/09f7fc67bcc174ba7407728777812d44.poster.avif?t=1753785118\" width=640 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/09f7fc67bcc174ba7407728777812d44.webm?t=1753785118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/09f7fc67bcc174ba7407728777812d44.mp4?t=1753785118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/5e602989c57d79e316206fb6a9ccef70.webp?t=1753785118\" width=600 height=12 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[2]\u00a0 Stealth Infiltration</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>\u2605 For a more strategic experience, choose to play stealthily.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you aim for perfect combat outcomes, you can opt for a stealth approach. Knock out enemies and cleverly hide their bodies to earn more rewards. This requires careful planning and strategic thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/844395acdeeb16331b923b90bee12575.poster.avif?t=1753785118\" width=640 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/844395acdeeb16331b923b90bee12575.webm?t=1753785118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/844395acdeeb16331b923b90bee12575.mp4?t=1753785118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/5e602989c57d79e316206fb6a9ccef70.webp?t=1753785118\" width=600 height=12 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>\u2605 Epic Boss Battles, Worth Every Moment!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss has unique characteristics. Experience their power and defeat them to feel a great sense of accomplishment!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/bd84795c893ce5c24cf89bfe60dadebb.poster.avif?t=1753785118\" width=640 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/bd84795c893ce5c24cf89bfe60dadebb.webm?t=1753785118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/bd84795c893ce5c24cf89bfe60dadebb.mp4?t=1753785118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/5e602989c57d79e316206fb6a9ccef70.webp?t=1753785118\" width=600 height=12 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>\u25b6 Equipment and Item Crafting :</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a rich equipment system where items are obtained through synthesis. All materials come from battles, and the success rate for synthesis is 100%. There is no durability system for equipment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/9d335618cccec23b4427c687374f19f4.poster.avif?t=1753785118\" width=640 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/9d335618cccec23b4427c687374f19f4.webm?t=1753785118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/9d335618cccec23b4427c687374f19f4.mp4?t=1753785118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/extras/5e602989c57d79e316206fb6a9ccef70.webp?t=1753785118\" width=600 height=12 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>\u2665 Summary</strong></i> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game combines action-packed combat, stealth infiltration, and epic boss battles, all set against the backdrop of a mysterious and diverse alien world. With a compelling storyline and endless challenges, it offers players a deeply immersive and rewarding experience. Whether you prefer intense action or strategic stealth, there's something for everyone in this expansive universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
